{"slug": "big-train-the-part-ii-b8c82d6e", "synopsis": "The film presents the New York Central Railroad\u2019s operations and modernization. Trains carry harvests, food, fuel, and mail across Ohio and toward New York, while improved track, centralized control, remote signaling, and automatic safety systems coordinate frequent traffic. It also examines the railroad\u2019s extensive infrastructure and its relationship to publicly financed transportation facilities and free enterprise.", "clips": [{"id": "c641b49e-3cda-5ee2-996b-0b36900318bb", "sourceSlug": "big-train-the-part-ii-b8c82d6e", "sourceTitle": "Big Train, The (Part II)", "sourceYear": 1950, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 11.845, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8c82d6e-abda-5ec2-9c9d-5de862414c31/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/c641b49e-3cda-5ee2-996b-0b36900318bb.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8c82d6e-abda-5ec2-9c9d-5de862414c31/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/c641b49e-3cda-5ee2-996b-0b36900318bb.jpg"}, {"id": "b1de41b6-13ad-5d2a-bdd0-00fcf7e6e883", "sourceSlug": "big-train-the-part-ii-b8c82d6e", "sourceTitle": "Big Train, The (Part II)", "sourceYear": 1950, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 11.845, "endSeconds": 42.042, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8c82d6e-abda-5ec2-9c9d-5de862414c31/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/b1de41b6-13ad-5d2a-bdd0-00fcf7e6e883.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8c82d6e-abda-5ec2-9c9d-5de862414c31/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/b1de41b6-13ad-5d2a-bdd0-00fcf7e6e883.jpg"}, {"id": "2dfcbc67-44ac-5c37-815d-fe332990ba34", "sourceSlug": "big-train-the-part-ii-b8c82d6e", "sourceTitle": "Big Train, The (Part II)", "sourceYear": 1950, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 42.042, "endSeconds": 72.239, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/b8c82d6e-abda-5ec2-9c9d-5de86